{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"REM Skriva till fil\nOPEN OUT 1, \u0022highscore.txt\u0022\nPRINT #1, \u0022Player: Anna\u0022\nPRINT #1, \u0022Score: 1000\u0022\nPRINT #1, \u0022Level: 5\u0022\nCLOSE 1\n\nREM L\u00E4sa fr\u00E5n fil\nOPEN IN 2, \u0022highscore.txt\u0022\nINPUT #2, line1$\nINPUT #2, line2$\nINPUT #2, line3$\nCLOSE 2\n\nPRINT line1$\nPRINT line2$\nPRINT line3$\n\nREM Skriva utan nyrad (semikolon)\nOPEN OUT 3, \u0022data.txt\u0022\nPRINT #3, \u0022Name: \u0022;\nPRINT #3, \u0022Erik\u0022\nCLOSE 3\nREM Resulterar i: \u0022Name: Erik\u0022 p\u00E5 samma rad\n\nREM Numeriska v\u00E4rden\nOPEN OUT 4, \u0022numbers.txt\u0022\nscore = 5000\nPRINT #4, score\nCLOSE 4\n\nOPEN IN 5, \u0022numbers.txt\u0022\nINPUT #5, loadedScore\nCLOSE 5\nPRINT \u0022Loaded score: \u0022 \u0026 loadedScore","ScreenWidth":null,"ScreenHeight":null,"Sprites":null,"MapWidth":null,"MapHeight":null,"MapData":null}